# Benchmark: function calls
# Workload: 300 calls each of three function shapes - a function that returns
# a value, one with two parameters, and one that returns nothing.
# Measures call setup, scope creation and return.

to double number
    return number times 2
.

to combine first and second
    return first plus second
.

to touch value
    scratch is value plus 1
.

total is 0
count from 1 to 300 as n
    double n make d
    combine n and d make c
    touch c
    total is total plus c
.
say "function calls total" total
